# Benchmark: desktop UI construction (Windows)
# Workload: a window with a column of 100 buttons, each with text and a click
# handler. Measures creating, configuring and placing controls; the window is
# never shown.

create window into app
create column into list
put list in app
count from 1 to 100 as n
    create button into b
    text of b is n
    put b in list
    when b clicked
        say n
    .
.
say "ui controls" 100
